01K84P2E056E4XX8V1N4PS4KWS	3                         	doc-1cLU67Foo5pS72HDdd6JkDean1TEThcS9	01K84P2CC8ECH0HSK986574YWX	ZapisnikOPretresu.pdf (chunk 4/11)	textract	\N	\N	["textract","reconstructed"]	3	davanje upozorenja omogućilo sakrivanje, uništenje ili oštećenje predmeta\n-\n- postoji sumnja da bi prethodno davanje upozorenja ugrozilo sigurnost osobe koja poduzima pretragu,\n- je vlasnik ili posjednik doma ili pokretne stvari nedostupan.\nIV. Pretrazi prisustvuju:\n1. a) vlasnik, korisnik, stanar ili njegov zastupnik\n/\nb) pretraga se obavlja bez prisutnosti vlasnika-korisnika:\n- koji je pozvan a nije se odazvao,\n- jer nije poznat,\njer je njegovo boravište nepoznato;\n-\nc) predstavnik državnog tijela ili ustanove\n/\nd) vojna osoba\n,\ne) zapovjednik broda/zrakoplova\n/\n2. državni odvjetnik\n/\n3. branitelj\n,\npretraga je:\na) započeta\n-\nb) obavljena\n- bez prisutnosti branitelja jer je osoba odbila uzeti branitelja,\n- bez prisutnosti branitelja koji je pozvan, ali nije došao u zakonom određenom roku,\n- bez prisutnosti branitelja jer su postojali razlozi iz članka 213. stavka 4. Zakona o\nkaznenom postupku;,\n4. punoljetni građani kao svjedoci\nDUBRAVCA PAULOSIE iz OSDNCA\nulica PROGRSICA\nbr. 5\nTOTIS	{"drive_file_id":"1cLU67Foo5pS72HDdd6JkDean1TEThcS9","s3_input_key":"textract\\/input\\/1cLU67Foo5pS72HDdd6JkDean1TEThcS9.pdf","s3_json_key":"textract\\/json\\/1cLU67Foo5pS72HDdd6JkDean1TEThcS9.json","s3_output_key":"textract\\/output\\/1cLU67Foo5pS72HDdd6JkDean1TEThcS9-searchable.pdf","local_json_path":"textract\\/json\\/1cLU67Foo5pS72HDdd6JkDean1TEThcS9.json","local_pdf_path":"textract\\/output\\/1cLU67Foo5pS72HDdd6JkDean1TEThcS9-searchable.pdf"}	drive-textract	1cLU67Foo5pS72HDdd6JkDean1TEThcS9	openai	text-embedding-3-small	1536	[0.012036131,0.03336403,-0.027094143,0.01761736,-0.0023653414,0.04068233,-0.019313313,-0.014513251,0.02236603,-0.008782984,0.0040574404,-0.00653713,0.049953543,-0.011460535,0.030588835,0.052050356,0.0077242977,-0.0140712755,-0.0