01K86075QKGYWKS0SD1CY5SQZ2	3                         	doc-1gsH6bRXZVIUawHivkpDd-NWNBq53ISRP	01K86073NQPD2DHKEMX5D78DBK	KP-DO-731.pdf (chunk 13/14)	textract	\N	\N	["textract","reconstructed"]	12	za privremeno oduzetu drogu i predmete na kojoj se nalazi\ndroga, izvješćujemo Vas da je isto proslijeđena na pohranu u Centar za forenzična\nispitivanje, istraživanja i vještačenja Ivan Vučetić" u Zagrebu, te Vas molimo da nam\nizdate Nalog za daktiloskopsko i biološko vještačenje pronađenih paketa droge, te\ntoksikološko vještačenje kako bi se vještačenjem utvrdilo da li se radi o materijama tipa\ndroge, te o kojoj vrsti i količini droge se radi, a isto bi bilo provedeno u navedenom\nCentru.\nTokom prethodno opisane pretrage, a na osnovu POPOP ser.br. 01422491 od\nosumnjičenog Andrije Glavaša privremeno je oduzet mobilni telefon marke Huawei nova\n9 SE"IMEI brojeva 8679090622498823 i 867909063998821, pozivnih brojeva 098/965 5609 i\n095/584 6314.\nShodno navedenome molimo Vas da izdate nalog za pretragu navedenog mobilnog\nuređaja. Također Vas molimo da se, prije izdavanja samog naloga, prethodno\nkonzultiramo u vezi S datumom njegovog izdavanja, kako bismo S nadležnom službom\nKOS ove PU uskladil	{"drive_file_id":"1gsH6bRXZVIUawHivkpDd-NWNBq53ISRP","s3_input_key":"textract\\/input\\/1gsH6bRXZVIUawHivkpDd-NWNBq53ISRP.pdf","s3_json_key":"textract\\/json\\/1gsH6bRXZVIUawHivkpDd-NWNBq53ISRP.json","s3_output_key":"textract\\/output\\/1gsH6bRXZVIUawHivkpDd-NWNBq53ISRP-searchable.pdf","local_json_path":"textract\\/json\\/1gsH6bRXZVIUawHivkpDd-NWNBq53ISRP.json","local_pdf_path":"textract\\/output\\/1gsH6bRXZVIUawHivkpDd-NWNBq53ISRP-searchable.pdf"}	drive-textract	1gsH6bRXZVIUawHivkpDd-NWNBq53ISRP	openai	text-embedding-3-small	1536	[-0.030079447,0.030137854,-0.07394287,0.0024555146,-0.018495454,0.009710113,-0.019157395,0.011379571,0.020675968,-0.05669343,-0.002623434,0.020208716,0.028736092,-0.016207857,0.0016110513,0.01387159,-0.03144227,-0.034148447,-0.094385214,0.014728221,0.000