01K88QDPKD3QD0FK91YC7TBESM	1                         	doc-1pVWZMR-Vq3-WS1hUJMwYw2W6j2xSFzN2	01K88QDKH7M3HX9MS36SYH0Y6Z	Pp-Prz-74.pdf (chunk 2/5)	textract	\N	\N	["textract","reconstructed"]	1	1,\n121/11, 91/12, 143/12, 56/13, 145/13, 152/14, 70/17, 126/19, 130/20, 80/22, 36/24\n72/25) pretragu doma i drugih prostorija kojima se koristi Andrija Glavaš, sin Tomislava iz\nOsijeka, Primorska 5, OIB: 25041200286, rođen 14. listopada 1989.\nII. Izvršenje naredbe povjerava se policijskim službenicima PU osječko-baranjske,\nSektoru kriminalističke policije, Službi organiziranog kriminaliteta koji su dužni postupiti u\nskladu S odredbom članka 247. do članka 260. Zakona o kaznenom postupku, a nakon\nizvršenja primjerak zapisnika o pretrazi dostaviti ovom sudu u roku od 3 (tri) dana,\npozivom na broj: Pp Prz-74/2025.\nIII. Rok za izvršenje naredbe je 3 (tri) dana od trenutka njezinog izdavanja.\nIV. Osobu kod koje se obavlja pretraga potrebno je upoznati da prije početka\npretrage ima pravo izvijestiti branitelja.\nObrazloženje\n1. Policijska uprava osječko-baranjska, Sektor kriminalističke policije, Služba\norganiziranog kriminaliteta, klasa: NK-214-05/25-01/1155, urbroj: 511-07-11-25-2 od 9.\nlip	{"drive_file_id":"1pVWZMR-Vq3-WS1hUJMwYw2W6j2xSFzN2","s3_input_key":"textract\\/input\\/1pVWZMR-Vq3-WS1hUJMwYw2W6j2xSFzN2.pdf","s3_json_key":"textract\\/json\\/1pVWZMR-Vq3-WS1hUJMwYw2W6j2xSFzN2.json","s3_output_key":"textract\\/output\\/1pVWZMR-Vq3-WS1hUJMwYw2W6j2xSFzN2-searchable.pdf","local_json_path":"textract\\/json\\/1pVWZMR-Vq3-WS1hUJMwYw2W6j2xSFzN2.json","local_pdf_path":"textract\\/output\\/1pVWZMR-Vq3-WS1hUJMwYw2W6j2xSFzN2-searchable.pdf"}	drive-textract	1pVWZMR-Vq3-WS1hUJMwYw2W6j2xSFzN2	openai	text-embedding-3-small	1536	[-0.011057357,0.045322478,-0.022309903,-0.032264452,-0.037397876,0.0064362995,-0.016942253,-0.016190782,0.008632156,-0.082603246,0.0132141765,0.020943591,0.031600814,-0.012979952,0.011994257,0.0107060205,-0.038490925,-0.032225415,-0.054769542,0.015117252,-