01K7YA2G9HZQ84WS59X2VQE0P5	01K7YA2G8S6WJE0H704P9DYRP6	ECLI:HR:VSRH:2008:2484	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	3	identitet norme. S druge strane, u pravu je žalitelj kada navodi da je prvostupanjski sud bio dužan prikupiti sve relevantne podatke na temelju kojih može donijeti meritornu odluku pa i pribaviti preslike članaka koji se odnose na kazneno djelo krijumčarenja iz članka 278. stavak 1. KZRM, ali i preslike koje se odnose na kazneno djelo prijevare iz članka 247. stavak 1. KZRM jer pobijano rješenje uopće ne sadrži obrazloženje postojanja ili nepostojanja identiteta norme u odnosu na kazneno djelo prijevare.Naime, za donošenje pravilne i zakonite odluke o postojanju ili nepostojanju identiteta norme pri odlučivanju o udovoljenju zamolnici o izručenju prvostupanjski sud mora utvrditi je li djelo zbog kojeg se traži izručenje kazneno djelo i po domaćem zakonu i po zakonu države u kojoj je djelo počinjeno (članak 35. stavak 1. točka 3. ZOMPO). To je moguće samo ako prvostupanjski sud usporedi odgovarajuće norme domaćeg zakona i zakona države moliteljice. Ako u spisu predmeta nedostaju odgovarajuće preslike zakonskih članaka države moliteljice, prvostupanjski sud je dužan na odgovarajući način pribaviti te preslike, a ne zaključiti da ne postoji identitet norme iz činjenice da zamolnici nisu priložene preslike odgovarajućih zakonskih članaka države moliteljice.Imajući na umu sve navedeno, riješeno je kao u izreci.Pri ponovnom odlučivanju sud će na odgovarajući način pribaviti preslike članaka koji se odnose na kazneno djelo krijumčarenja i	{"id":"ca799c76-848c-4178-87e8-cad4ec535030","broj_odluke":"I K\\u017e-1061\\/2008-3","sud":"Vrhovni sud Republike Hrvatske","datum_odluke":"2008-12-10","pravomocnost":"Pravomo\\u0107na odluka","datum_objave":"2009-02-11","upisnik":"I K\\u017e upisnik (drugostupanjski \\u017ealbeni)","vrsta_odluke":"Rje\\u0161enje","ecli":"ECLI:HR:VSRH:2008:2484","src":"https:\\/\\/odluke.sudovi.hr\\/Document\\/View?id=ca799c76-848c-4178-87e8-cad4ec535030","chunk":3}	https://odluke.sudovi.hr/Document/View?id=ca799c76-848c-4178-87e8-cad4ec535030	ca799c76-848c-4178-87e8-cad4ec535030	openai	text-embedding-3-small	1536	[-0.00992768,0.04567519,-0.06337236,0.05505351,0.03523739,0.04026009,-0.02158192,-0.00687678,-0.01367509,-0.01175234,0.01105583,-0.01957088,0.03094062,0.02305341,0.01752059,0.04375243,0.00260209,-0.05112952,-0.03939681,0.01640226,0.03417791,0.01235074,-0.00980506,-0.06113569,-0.01833482,-0.02607488,0.01834463,-0.02120914,0.03871011,-0.00061925,-0.01948259,-0.02069902,0.00406623,-0.0204832,-0.01623549,0.01148747,-0.05678006,-0.01409692,-0.01003559,0.04241828,0.04461571,-0.03003811,0.01436179,0.00514042,0.00415207,0.08883902,0.02295531,-0.03792531,-0.01356718,-0.01652979,-0.01202701,0.00958924,-0.00581731,0.0304305,-0.04689162,0.02764447,-0.01169348,0.02364201,0.00217904,-0.00602332,0.04944221,0.00962848,-0.00040129,-0.03176466,-0.05242444,0.01455799,0.00141263,0.02583944,0.00790683,0.04720554,0.06097873,-0.00825999,0.06329388,0.00292827,-0.01007483,0.0419474,0.06686471,0.01110488,0.00122195,-0.01659846,0.00133048,-0.03635572,-0.00352913,0.00031576,0.01305706,-0.01115393,-0.0305286,-0.00429186,0.00370571,-0.00077683,-0.05882053,0.01983574,0.00825999,0.04504735,0.03133302,-0.01789337,-0.00568487,-0.06199896,0.01648074,0.02268063,-0.04461571,0.0188057,0.00528266,0.01856045,-0.02672234,-0.02134648,-0.03704242,-0.00948133,-0.00221215,0.04190816,0.02805649,-0.06231288,-0.04653846,0.0130963,0.02470149,-0.0058124,0.00608218,0.042536,0.01470513,-0.01776584,-0.01697124,-0.00844147,0.00143961,-0.00747029,-0.00963829,0.02197432,0.00562111,0.0144697,-0.02562362,-0.05477883,-0.01134032,-0.05748638,-0.03245136,-0.03358931,-0.05874206,0.0184133,0.02164078,0.00827961,-0.00303373,0.02905711,0.00092949,0.00125445,-0.04959917,0.04901058,-0.02942989,-0.03333425,-0.05689778,0.00646967,-0.006401,0.02034586,-0.02303379,0.02122876,0.02397555,-0.00278603,-0.05454339,0.00454937,0.00275905,0.00093685,-0.03333425,-0.01789337,0.0178247,-0.0