01K7YA2GD1A70EHV7QREKKZ2QC	01K7YA2GCPFWXAZD2BKJ9VRPZV	935ca835-3ccf-40c7-9694-c25432fcf677	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	4	e tužbe.6.3. U konkretnom slučaju postoji subjektivni identitet jer su iste stranke u obje parnice.6.4. Međutim, po stajalištu ovog suda ne postoji objektivni identitet.7. Ovo stoga što je u parnici koja se vodila pod brojem P-4717/2011 odlučeno o zahtjevu tužitelja za utvrđenje da je tužitelj kupoprodajnim ugovorima pobliže označenim u tužbi stekao pravo vlasništva na spornim nekretninama, dok u ovoj parnici tužitelj traži da se utvrdi kako je temeljem tih ugovora stekao valjanu pravnu osnovu za stjecanje prava vlasništva.8. Da bi se radilo o presuđenoj stvari moraju se kumulativno ispuniti uvjeti navedeni u točki 6.2. ovog rješenja. Budući ne postoji objektivni identitet spora to je prvostupanjski sud počinio bitnu povredu odredaba parničnog postupka iz čl. 354. stavak 1. u vezi sa čl. 332. stavak 2. ZPP-a na koju pravilno ukazuje u žalbi tužitelj, a koja je utjecala na zakonitost pobijane odluke, pa je na temelju odredbe čl. 380. toč. 2. ZPP-a valjalo rješenje ukinuti u pobijanom dijelu (točka II. izreke) i u tom dijelu predmet vratiti prvostupanjskom sudu na ponovni postupak.9. U preostalom nepobijanom dijelu (točka I. izreke) rješenje prvostupanjskog suda ostaje neizmijenjeno.10. U ponovljenom postupku, prvostupanjski sud će otkloniti nedostatke na koje mu se ukazuje u ovom rješenju te nakon što raspravi sporna pitanja, donijeti novu i na zakonu osnovanu odluku, koja će sadržajno opravdati svoju izreku.Osijek, 15. siječnja 2024.Sutki	{"id":"935ca835-3ccf-40c7-9694-c25432fcf677","broj_odluke":"G\\u017e-1992\\/2024-2","sud":"\\u017dupanijski sud u Osijeku","datum_odluke":"2025-01-15","pravomocnost":"Pravomo\\u0107na odluka","datum_objave":"2025-04-14","upisnik":"G\\u017e - Upisnik za drugostupanjske gra\\u0111anske predmete","vrsta_odluke":"Rje\\u0161enje","ecli":null,"src":"https:\\/\\/odluke.sudovi.hr\\/Document\\/View?id=935ca835-3ccf-40c7-9694-c25432fcf677","chunk":4}	https://odluke.sudovi.hr/Document/View?id=935ca835-3ccf-40c7-9694-c25432fcf677	935ca835-3ccf-40c7-9694-c25432fcf677	openai	text-embedding-3-small	1536	[-0.02580905,0.03072595,-0.02104285,0.03019847,-0.00402442,0.02590324,-0.00186032,-0.01130323,0.03959899,-0.04261318,0.04890532,0.00876471,0.00094841,-0.00163661,0.00978672,0.04012647,0.02707124,-0.04566506,-0.03219537,0.01546659,0.02810737,-0.04329138,0.00523245,-0.03257215,-0.01501446,-0.04962119,0.02081678,-0.03309963,0.02239924,-0.01186839,0.00774742,-0.01744465,0.03285473,-0.01804749,-0.02266298,0.01045549,-0.03153602,0.00801588,-0.02104285,0.02273833,0.05346429,-0.00123629,-0.0409177,-0.03044337,-0.0440826,0.06687746,0.03097086,0.01499562,-0.02109937,-0.02341653,-0.00949942,0.03313731,0.01585278,0.04913138,-0.04265086,0.01401601,-0.00073294,0.05636545,0.00691852,0.01084168,0.00122569,-0.02264414,0.0096313,-0.0344937,-0.0256395,0.00476855,-0.0135733,0.04020183,-0.00946646,0.01807575,0.01576801,0.00941465,0.02693937,0.00738478,-0.00648052,0.04295228,0.06503126,0.00115976,0.02398169,0.0087553,0.00904259,0.01017291,-0.00258561,0.01889524,-0.00811949,-0.01821704,-0.03174324,-0.01596582,-0.00746484,-0.00340981,-0.02482943,0.04739822,-0.00638162,0.01400659,0.0243773,-0.05964339,0.00970194,-0.07776623,-0.01198143,0.00718226,0.01463769,0.02337885,-0.00610846,0.01326246,-0.01563614,-0.04046557,-0.002482,-0.0030401,0.0111902,0.01828298,-0.003942,-0.00309661,-0.02692053,0.01549485,-0.03880776,-0.03569938,-0.02311511,0.00894368,0.01676646,0.00039061,0.01515575,-0.01430801,-0.00820897,-0.00388549,0.01133149,-0.01287627,0.0447608,-0.02326582,-0.02415124,-0.02624234,-0.00747426,-0.01042723,-0.03511537,0.02923769,-0.03877008,-0.00201339,-0.01860324,0.01315885,0.01985601,0.02189059,-0.02592208,-0.00133637,-0.04962119,0.01647446,-0.01095472,0.01610711,0.02550763,-0.01892349,-0.0358124,0.03635873,-0.03673551,0.00213819,0.01200027,0.0108511,-0.02091098,-0.0087553,-0.04016415,0.02569601,-0.03628337,0.00015674,-0.02