01K70RGA97GN4PSNBDF3JE9YYW	zakonhr-zszd-2025-10-08	zszd	\N	HR	HR	hr	\N	\N	\N	as-published	\N	\N	[]	https://www.zakon.hr/z/293/zakon-o-suzbijanju-zlouporabe-droga	0	Članak 34. (1) Liječenje ovisnika i povremenih uzimatelja droge provode zdravstvene ustanove i zdravstveni djelatnici sukladno propisima iz područja zdravstva. (2) Mjere prevencije ovisnosti i specifične postupke za oslobađanje od ovisnosti, mjere i postupke skrbi o ovisnicima i povremenim uzimateljima droga provode Hrvatski zavod za javno zdravstvo i zavodi za javno zdravstvo županija, odnosno Grada Zagreba.	{"source":"zakon.hr","url":"https:\\/\\/www.zakon.hr\\/z\\/293\\/zakon-o-suzbijanju-zlouporabe-droga","title":"zszd","date_published":null,"article_number":"34","heading_chain":[]}	openai	text-embedding-3-small	1536	[-0.0341069,0.02076238,0.00845503,0.03173624,-0.01346878,0.06136948,-2.825e-05,0.01535193,0.03391572,0.01742625,0.03439367,-0.00723147,0.0066149,0.01064885,0.0139563,-0.01561002,0.01224522,0.00200144,-0.00254033,0.07570814,-0.00274824,0.01719684,0.05169566,-5.945e-05,0.00178277,-0.08802027,0.02131681,-0.00718845,-0.00943962,-0.03144947,0.02988177,-0.02372571,0.01986383,0.00952565,0.01225478,-0.02393601,0.03011119,0.01436734,0.01581077,0.06936089,-0.02594342,-0.01276141,0.01869762,-0.01614533,-0.03391572,0.0505868,0.02349629,-0.00388817,0.01208271,0.00510934,-0.02630667,-0.00117099,-0.00474371,-0.01414748,-0.01569606,0.00420123,0.02829496,0.04236597,-0.00629945,0.02433749,0.06232539,-0.02301833,0.04045415,-0.0113371,-0.04542488,0.00471981,0.01857335,-0.0175792,0.00120505,-0.02525516,0.05536636,0.00616085,0.01412836,-0.00341499,-0.0314877,-0.00218187,0.05314864,-0.02326687,-0.00830209,0.00993191,0.00503765,-0.01371732,-0.00591709,0.03508193,0.00925322,-0.02225361,-0.049325,0.01760788,0.02452867,0.00024286,0.00172183,0.0325392,-0.03668786,0.05207802,0.00524795,-0.0375673,0.03462309,-0.06595785,-0.02254038,0.01089738,0.00308281,0.00087824,0.00189629,0.01335407,-0.01740714,-0.00643806,-0.03248