01K70RGA7W02NM59QJ8VKWAMMH	zakonhr-zszd-2025-10-08	zszd	\N	HR	HR	hr	\N	\N	\N	as-published	\N	\N	[]	https://www.zakon.hr/z/293/zakon-o-suzbijanju-zlouporabe-droga	0	Članak 15. (NN 39/19) (1) Drogu mogu izrađivati samo pravne osobe koje za obavljanje te djelatnosti udovoljavaju uvjetima propisanim za pravne osobe koje proizvode lijekove i imaju odobrenje Agencije za lijekove i medicinske proizvode, odnosno veterinarsko-medicinske proizvode i koje imaju odobrenje ministarstva nadležnog za poljoprivredu, u skladu s posebnim propisima. (2) Ako ovim Zakonom nije drukčije propisano, na izradu droga primjenjuju se propisi o proizvodnji lijekova.	{"source":"zakon.hr","url":"https:\\/\\/www.zakon.hr\\/z\\/293\\/zakon-o-suzbijanju-zlouporabe-droga","title":"zszd","date_published":null,"article_number":"15","heading_chain":[]}	openai	text-embedding-3-small	1536	[-0.00442137,0.01924648,-0.03408445,0.00101368,0.03022486,0.04007109,-0.02943579,0.0257992,0.01802856,-0.00354224,0.00774062,-0.00893709,0.01675061,0.02698281,-0.02847518,-0.00659561,-0.01777126,-0.01469216,-0.00448141,0.00931447,0.03849295,0.0354739,0.00312198,-0.02545612,0.01484655,-0.06679659,0.03442752,-0.00313699,0.00220425,0.00968328,0.00066042,-0.01656192,0.03405014,0.01415182,-0.01696503,-0.00714881,0.03677758,-0.03701773,0.0128996,0.05221593,-0.03322676,-0.02262576,0.01667342,0.00026253,-0.0470012,0.0336556,-0.03278076,-0.00527906,-0.0292814,-0.02463274,-0.01146726,-0.00827238,0.00073386,-0.00063898,-0.04796181,0.00074619,0.02423821,0.02864672,0.00187404,0.03068801,0.03130554,-0.00618821,0.04905964,-0.00842677,-0.01609877,-0.00149345,0.01750537,-0.01157876,0.01173315,0.00759481,0.03945356,-0.01434051,-0.02003555,0.03996817,-0.03507936,-0.02247138,0.0164933,0.01919502,0.02789195,0.00970043,-0.01544693,0.01455493,-0.00087645,0.01223918,0.03756665,-0.02852664,-0.03259207,-0.01778841,-0.00136587,-0.00912578,0.00713595,-0.0343589,-0.01345709,0.05928326,0.016459,-0.00293757,0.01482082,-0.03243769,-0.03790972,-0.016501