01K70RGA8K9EDWBND1R3YZKP2A	zakonhr-zszd-2025-10-08	zszd	\N	HR	HR	hr	\N	\N	\N	as-published	\N	\N	[]	https://www.zakon.hr/z/293/zakon-o-suzbijanju-zlouporabe-droga	0	Članak 22. (NN 39/19) Dozvolu za uvoz i izvoz droge, lijeka ili veterinarsko-medicinskog proizvoda koji sadrži drogu te dijelova biljke iz kojih se izrađuje droga izdaje na zahtjev osobe iz članka 20. stavka 1. ovoga Zakona ministarstvo nadležno za zdravstvo ako su ispunjeni uvjeti određeni ovim Zakonom, drugim propisima i međunarodnim ugovorima kojih je Republika Hrvatska stranka.	{"source":"zakon.hr","url":"https:\\/\\/www.zakon.hr\\/z\\/293\\/zakon-o-suzbijanju-zlouporabe-droga","title":"zszd","date_published":null,"article_number":"22","heading_chain":[]}	openai	text-embedding-3-small	1536	[-0.0130036,0.01130106,-0.02112542,0.00375471,0.01321207,0.04033982,-0.01893644,0.0236966,0.00691875,-0.00490784,0.03226143,0.0296555,-0.0032509,0.03019406,0.00203697,-0.01507966,0.0065018,-0.00569396,0.01675614,0.02661525,0.03127118,0.0172947,-0.01415021,-0.01282118,-0.00659735,-0.06129151,0.02029152,-0.04763643,0.01329894,-0.02651101,0.0072054,-0.02496482,0.04256355,0.01451504,0.01853686,-0.00875159,0.01701673,-0.03172287,0.00397622,0.05673982,0.00020535,-0.02578135,0.02527753,0.01808517,-0.03547541,0.01130106,-0.065461,-0.02748389,-0.00261462,-0.01595699,-0.03623982,-0.02192457,-0.02133389,0.00267325,-0.03373813,0.02188982,0.01791144,0.04965168,-0.02296694,0.03095847,0.00501208,0.01254322,-0.03662203,-0.00925106,-0.02925592,-0.00532913,0.02819618,-0.03634406,-0.00603707,-0.00957246,0.01949237,0.00422812,-0.01858898,-0.02089957,-0.00635413,0.01930127,-0.00989385,0.01630445,0.01289936,0.01339449,-0.03121906,-0.00086919,-0.03026355,0.00342463,0.00702299,-0.02086482,-0.02465211,0.00877765,-0.00547246,-0.03665677,0.00610222,-0.00665381,-0.0035419,0.08206947,0.01145741,-0.01715572,0.00100546,-0.03035042,-0.01014576,0.0013388,0.01774639,0.01091885,-0.04530846,-0.02166398,-0.01264745,0.03215719,-0.04673304,0.00328999,0.0