01K70RGA8PSTZ0XJR3ZV020YQN	zakonhr-zszd-2025-10-08	zszd	\N	HR	HR	hr	\N	\N	\N	as-published	\N	\N	[]	https://www.zakon.hr/z/293/zakon-o-suzbijanju-zlouporabe-droga	0	Članak 23. (NN 39/19) (1) Provoz droge te dijelova biljke iz kojih se može dobiti droga dopušten je ako je za pošiljku izdana: a) izvozna dozvola države iz koje se droga izvozi, b) uvozna dozvola države u koju se droga uvozi . (2) Prijevoznik je dužan paziti da tijekom provoza priroda droge, originalna pakovina te pečati ne budu izmijenjeni niti izloženi utjecajima koji mogu izmijeniti prirodu droge.	{"source":"zakon.hr","url":"https:\\/\\/www.zakon.hr\\/z\\/293\\/zakon-o-suzbijanju-zlouporabe-droga","title":"zszd","date_published":null,"article_number":"23","heading_chain":[]}	openai	text-embedding-3-small	1536	[-0.00430087,0.00010678,-0.01155319,0.02712894,0.04340631,0.00099044,-0.01890607,0.01011255,0.00976642,0.0227696,0.00610401,0.040076,-0.00024776,0.01888736,-0.0099161,-0.02177799,0.00202999,0.0016137,-0.01771801,0.0428076,0.0215909,0.03504311,-0.02565088,-0.02329347,0.00471716,-0.07790684,0.05807465,-0.00913029,0.0408618,-0.00184056,0.02102961,-0.02134767,0.03154441,0.02035606,-0.00417458,-0.01263835,-0.00512643,-0.01742801,0.01529511,0.0420218,-0.00979448,-0.00824626,0.01220802,0.00330225,-0.03955213,0.05216241,-0.03977664,-0.02383605,-0.02011284,-0.01471511,-0.02258251,0.01856929,-0.00087584,-0.00224398,-0.02722249,0.01745607,-0.0049674,0.03569794,-0.01960768,0.01771801,-0.01006577,-0.00380507,-0.0237425,0.01281609,-0.0102061,0.00712836,0.0319186,-0.01410705,0.00795626,0.00162774,0.00835852,0.03966438,-0.00186044,-0.05669013,-0.0007934,0.00575788,-0.00397813,0.03146957,0.01072997,0.00915836,-0.06694301,0.00264741,-0.03676439,0.00238197,-0.00286257,-0.02497734,-0.01839155,0.02404186,-0.00253281,-0.05070306,-0.01145964,-0.03356505,0.01681995,0.06361269,-0.01652995,0.01094513,0.00627708,-0.05646562,-0.04194696,-0.00607595,-0.00480837,0.01856929,-0.04265792,0.00121496,0.00182419,0.00844739,-0.056315