1c20b2238a53de4fdc69d4e4d228a97d5680b5a3c3a2	34	2025-10-08 01:55:50	2025-10-08 01:55:50	01K70RESNBMQT0V8J8XGB577DD	'53/91':21 '67':3 'br':20 'danom':4 'droga':17 'i':15 'na':6 'narodne':18 'novine':19 'o':13 'ovoga':8 'prestaje':10 'proizvodnji':14 'prometu':16 'snagu':7 'stupanja':5 'važiti':11 'zakon':12 'zakona':9 'zszd':1 'članak':2	Članak 67. Danom stupanja na snagu ovoga Zakona prestaje važiti Zakon o proizvodnji i prometu droga (»Narodne novine«, br. 53/91.).	active
01K70RGAA44D7QBE57VSTMTVRK	zakonhr-zszd-2025-10-08	zszd	\N	HR	HR	hr	\N	\N	\N	as-published	\N	\N	[]	https://www.zakon.hr/z/293/zakon-o-suzbijanju-zlouporabe-droga	0	Članak 43. (1) U cilju suzbijanja neovlaštene uporabe i prometa droge, tijela državne vlasti, jedinice lokalne i područne (regionalne) samouprave, prosvjetne i odgojne ustanove, ustanove u kulturi, udruge kao i odgovorne osobe u tim tijelima, ustanovama i udrugama o svakoj okolnosti važnoj za primjenu ovoga Zakona, koju saznaju u obavljanju svoje djelatnosti, odmah po saznanju dužne su izvijestiti policijsku postaju. (2) Obveza iz stavka 1. ovoga članka odnosi se i na pravne osobe, odgovorne osobe u pravnim osobama i fizičke osobe koje obavljaju ugostiteljsku djelatnost ili priređuju kulturno-zabavne priredbe, sportske priredbe, predstave ili obavljaju turističku ili sličnu djelatnost.	{"source":"zakon.hr","url":"https:\\/\\/www.zakon.hr\\/z\\/293\\/zakon-o-suzbijanju-zlouporabe-droga","title":"zszd","date_published":null,"article_number":"43","heading_chain":[]}	openai	text-embedding-3-small	1536	[-0.00522961,0.01462775,-0.01069607,0.02677332,0.00982446,0.02912286,-0.03050605,-0.00114575,0.00175505,-0.00115286,0.03469352,0.00249875,0.00043669,0.02105107,0.01776362,0.02362798,-0.03431457,-0.00633332,0.01002342,0.01406878,0.01186136,-0.00784915,-0.03672095,-0.05062867,-0.03209767,-0.03035447,0.04744543,-0.01530039,0.0043438,0.04790018,0.00693965,-0.01442879,0.01822784,-0.00065844,0.02647016,-0.02275638,-0.02910391,-0.01150135,0.00411879,0.03499669,0.02372272,-0.05729832,0.03490195,-0.04520959,-0.10133313,0.0433527,-0.03461773,-0.00330166,-0.0212216,0.01065817,-0.01241085,-0.00109128,-0.00525329,-0.03503459,-0.02789125,0.0212216,-0.01319718,0.03785782,-0.00756493,0.0379715,0.03963891,-0.01019395,0.01084765,-0.01925102,-0.02525749,-0.00455222,0.02578803,-0.00329693,0.01448564,0.00146964,0.0384452,0.00215058,-0.00975815,-0.01887207,-0.02855442,-0.03321559,0.0424432,-0.01539513,-0.03029762,-0.01296033,0.000432