01K70RGAD43Y95AT13F6GJWRW2	zakonhr-zszd-2025-10-08	zszd	\N	HR	HR	hr	\N	\N	\N	as-published	\N	\N	[]	https://www.zakon.hr/z/293/zakon-o-suzbijanju-zlouporabe-droga	0	Članak 16. (1) Opći program za suzbijanje zlouporabe droga Vlada Republike Hrvatske donijet će u roku od tri mjeseca od dana stupanja na snagu ovoga Zakona. (2) Posebne programe mjera za suzbijanje zlouporabe droga i skrbi o ovisnicima, te pomoći ovisnicima o drogama i povremenim uzimateljima droga Povjerenstvo će donijeti u roku od šest mjeseci od dana stupanja na snagu ovoga Zakona.	{"source":"zakon.hr","url":"https:\\/\\/www.zakon.hr\\/z\\/293\\/zakon-o-suzbijanju-zlouporabe-droga","title":"zszd","date_published":null,"article_number":"16","heading_chain":[]}	openai	text-embedding-3-small	1536	[-0.06880738,0.03390615,0.03075509,0.00493851,-0.00732023,0.03980288,-0.0054084,0.01905379,0.01749668,-0.02821213,0.02957575,-0.00806653,-0.02778831,-0.01245683,0.02721706,-0.02165203,-0.02531905,-0.00673977,-0.01423506,0.03333491,0.00143617,0.0365044,-0.00690562,0.00281016,-0.02050954,-0.05535548,0.03722306,-0.00067087,0.01968031,-0.03252411,0.0154789,-0.01995672,0.01374674,-0.02721706,0.03665182,-0.03372188,0.02979688,0.01040219,0.02745662,0.05130149,-0.03313221,-0.02402915,0.02373431,-0.03762846,-0.05115407,0.03910264,-0.00564335,0.01057725,0.0222417,0.02955732,-0.03385088,0.00504446,-0.05576088,0.04717378,-0.01095501,0.01417056,0.03613585,0.03884466,-0.04429913,0.00509053,0.03230298,0.03753632,-0.02004886,-0.00735248,-0.06139962,0.00622381,0.03044183,0.00831991,0.05167003,-0.04625242,0.00089372,0.02402915,0.01205143,-0.02390015,-0.01099186,0.00713596,-0.01524856,-0.00065647,-0.01276088,0.01294515,0.0075736,0.0175059,-0.00340904,0.05063811,-0.01309257,0.00941172,-0.0322477,0.04017142,0.01788366,-0.01506428,0.0029046,0.05093294,-0.03950804,0.03972917,0.01101029,-0.04382002,-0.00920442,-0.08085881,-0.00527941,-0.00081944,-0.00251302,0.00753214,1.614e-05,-0.02277609,-0.03263468,-0.00917217,-0.02161517,-0.00292763