01K88Z9VDCS5VP66H0PW3FH0N2	zakonhr-zakon-o-pomilovanju-zakonhr-2025-10-23	zakon_o_pomilovanju-_zakon.hr	\N	HR	HR	hr	\N	\N	\N	as-published	\N	\N	[]	https://www.zakon.hr/z/274/zakon-o-pomilovanju	0	Članak 3. (1) Kad se pomilovanjem izrečena kazna zamjenjuje blažom kaznom ili uvjetnom osudom primijenit će se kaznenopravne sankcije propisane kaznenim zakonodavstvom Republike Hrvatske. (2) Prijevremena rehabilitacija pomilovanjem nije ogra­ničena ni visinom izrečene kazne niti vrstom kaznenog djela za koje je izrečena osuda. (3) Pravni učinci prijevremene rehabilitacije pomilovanjem istovjetni su učincima rehabilitacije prema odredbama Kaznenog zakonika.	{"source":"zakon.hr","url":"https:\\/\\/www.zakon.hr\\/z\\/274\\/zakon-o-pomilovanju","title":"zakon_o_pomilovanju-_zakon.hr","date_published":null,"article_number":"3","heading_chain":[]}	openai	text-embedding-3-small	1536	[-0.01719097,0.03949012,0.00335715,0.04597357,0.01701415,0.03330137,-0.01057981,0.0074265,0.03888106,-0.00785873,0.01769196,0.01090399,0.0031877,0.04542346,0.05214267,0.00856602,0.01959771,0.00595299,-0.00493626,0.04188703,-0.04884201,-0.03135633,-0.02748591,-0.00635084,0.03560004,-0.04569851,0.02530511,-0.02064881,0.05461817,-0.01456812,-0.00548638,-0.01043246,-0.02809496,-0.03874354,0.02768238,-0.00426091,0.00368869,0.02068811,0.00841375,0.03208326,-0.00373535,-0.08063056,-0.04683803,-0.02196515,-0.03422477,0.08243807,0.00499029,0.02825213,-0.00530955,-0.00160367,-0.00288317,0.01100222,-0.0426729,0.0513568,-0.00790294,0.01731868,0.00194381,0.00915051,-0.01955841,0.00116776,0.05288925,0.00957292,0.0057074,-0.03740755,-0.05210338,0.00554532,0.00060015,0.00315332,-0.02106139,-0.01770179,0.01394925,0.00648836,0.02367442,0.00150053,-0.04675944,0.01131657,0.09076832,-0.00547164,0.02188656,0.02235809,-0.00916033,-0.00545691,0.01193545,0.01633634,0.00799626,0.02058987,-0.03206362,-0.02503005,0.02015764,0.02212232,-0.01780002,0.00827622,-0.03355677,0.05308572,0.03123845,-0.02459782,0.0111201,-0.0921829,-0.00