e se zatim ponoviti nakon tri godine od dana posljednje odluke o pomilovanju.	active
01K88Z9VEK0682F9RJPZ3F9026	zakonhr-zakon-o-pomilovanju-zakonhr-2025-10-23	zakon_o_pomilovanju-_zakon.hr	\N	HR	HR	hr	\N	\N	\N	as-published	\N	\N	[]	https://www.zakon.hr/z/274/zakon-o-pomilovanju	0	Članak 6. (1) Molba se predaje ministarstvu nadležnom za poslove pravosuđa. Ako je molba predana drugom tijelu, kaznionici ili zatvoru, bez odgode se dostavlja ministarstvu nadležnom za poslove pravosuđa. (2) Molbu osuđenik koji se nalazi na izvršavanju kazne zatvora upućuje ministarstvu nadležnom za poslove pravosuđa preko kaznionice ili zatvora u kojoj se izvršava kazna. Kaznionica ili zatvor je obvezna pri dostavljanju molbe priložiti i izvješće o ponašanju osuđenika, stanju njegova fizičkog i psihičkog zdravlja i drugim podacima relevantnim za rješavanje molbe.	{"source":"zakon.hr","url":"https:\\/\\/www.zakon.hr\\/z\\/274\\/zakon-o-pomilovanju","title":"zakon_o_pomilovanju-_zakon.hr","date_published":null,"article_number":"6","heading_chain":[]}	openai	text-embedding-3-small	1536	[-0.01421808,0.02540839,0.00212585,0.053154,0.00589616,0.01896334,-0.03902446,0.01532471,0.03017136,-0.01378427,0.00113873,-0.00757383,0.00056107,0.00028192,0.03651018,0.05311859,0.03530616,-0.0191404,-0.03888281,0.03569569,-0.04291982,0.00153601,0.04607153,-0.01532471,-0.0242752,-0.04791297,0.02960476,-0.046284,0.03291582,-0.00598027,0.04461962,-0.0175557,-0.03445626,0.00714445,0.02303576,0.05850127,-0.00298349,0.00011675,0.00333098,0.03796209,0.00512152,-0.01181889,-0.00767121,0.00864062,-0.03824538,0.06306947,-0.00102143,-0.03259711,0.00263158,0.01096899,0.00511266,0.01636053,0.03789126,0.04309688,0.00799878,0.02356695,-0.00799435,0.01363377,0.00590944,0.03013595,0.00582977,0.00082168,-0.0268603,-0.03098585,-0.00426719,-0.02625829,0.00929575,0.02889651,0.03693513,0.00724626,0.04904617,0.00218672,0.06083849,-0.01548407,-0.03592587,0.0182905,0.07833222,-0.01212875,0.03332306,0.02156615,-0.01802491,-0.0107211,-0.01814885,0.02680718,0.00424063,-0.00366518,-0.03944941,0.01244746,-0.00887966,-0.0