 za rješavanje molbe.	active
01K88Z9VEW6MHJVRE9GBVVHV7F	zakonhr-zakon-o-pomilovanju-zakonhr-2025-10-23	zakon_o_pomilovanju-_zakon.hr	\N	HR	HR	hr	\N	\N	\N	as-published	\N	\N	[]	https://www.zakon.hr/z/274/zakon-o-pomilovanju	0	Članak 7. (1) Ako je molba podnesena od neovlaštene osobe ili je pod­nesena prije proteka roka predviđenog člankom 5. ovoga Zakona ministarstvo nadležno za poslove pravosuđa dostavit će pisanu obavijest o tome podnositelju molbe. (2) Molbu zajedno s pisanom obavijesti iz stavka 1. ovoga članka ministarstvo nadležno za poslove pravosuđa dostavit će Predsjedniku Republike.	{"source":"zakon.hr","url":"https:\\/\\/www.zakon.hr\\/z\\/274\\/zakon-o-pomilovanju","title":"zakon_o_pomilovanju-_zakon.hr","date_published":null,"article_number":"7","heading_chain":[]}	openai	text-embedding-3-small	1536	[0.00836519,0.00235507,-0.03449359,0.01160174,0.01301746,0.05723408,-0.01250994,0.00203787,0.0133469,-0.02594588,0.00902852,-0.01009699,0.01041753,0.03299774,0.03442236,0.06318186,0.00422266,0.01367634,0.01821732,-0.01484275,-0.00030023,-0.0075861,0.05121506,0.02315006,-0.01595574,-0.03668394,0.03506344,-0.02749515,0.0444125,0.00661112,0.02753077,-0.01241199,-0.02671161,0.00518205,0.03237447,0.01096957,-0.00096718,-0.00365726,-0.02542945,0.03828664,0.02592807,0.01267021,-0.00102617,-0.00253315,-0.0434865,0.06485578,-0.04181257,0.00344357,-0.02151175,0.01537698,0.03326486,-0.01015041,0.00126991,0.03864279,0.02284733,-0.01892963,0.00221706,0.0220816,0.00265113,0.10072058,-0.03924826,0.02528699,-0.05214106,-0.05228352,-0.01041753,-0.05139314,-0.00143798,0.02621299,0.02398703,-0.01268802,0.01998028,-0.00982097,0.03023754,-0.03073616,-0.04754666,-0.00694502,0.0635024,-0.01408592,0.0303622,0.02617738,-0.01894744,-0.0004669,-0.01730022,0.0218501,-0.00462556,-0.02660476,-0.04384266,0.02021178,-0.00753267,-0.03550863,0.00062271,0.02722803,-0.03429771,0.08277037,0.03038,0.00857443,0.015653,-0.1007918,0.03121697,0.00572074,0.00671797,0.01226063,0.00073624,0.01577766,-0.03125258,-0.01470029,-0.02569