01K88Z9VFJC1A7WPNWDCSC744P	zakonhr-zakon-o-pomilovanju-zakonhr-2025-10-23	zakon_o_pomilovanju-_zakon.hr	\N	HR	HR	hr	\N	\N	\N	as-published	\N	\N	[]	https://www.zakon.hr/z/274/zakon-o-pomilovanju	0	Članak 12. (1) Odluku o pomilovanju Predsjednik Republike dostavlja osuđeniku putem ministarstva nadležnog za poslove pravosuđa. (2) O odluci iz stavka 1. ovoga članka ministarstvo nadležno za poslove pravosuđa obvezno je izvijestiti podnositelja molbe, sud koji je donio odluku prvog stupnja, kaznionicu ili zatvor i suca izvršenja. (3) Odluka o pomilovanju objavljuje se u službenom glasilu Republike Hrvatske.	{"source":"zakon.hr","url":"https:\\/\\/www.zakon.hr\\/z\\/274\\/zakon-o-pomilovanju","title":"zakon_o_pomilovanju-_zakon.hr","date_published":null,"article_number":"12","heading_chain":[]}	openai	text-embedding-3-small	1536	[0.01065543,0.01666999,-0.01536126,0.02093958,0.0125489,0.06333852,-0.00153265,-0.00156165,0.04005994,-0.00175541,0.02216477,-0.00809367,-0.01106382,0.03376693,0.0377952,0.024281,0.00549942,0.0060192,0.00372429,0.03163213,-0.01770954,-0.01281807,0.02892187,0.02624873,0.0081772,-0.04061685,0.02405824,-0.05223757,0.05349989,-0.01339354,0.04819074,-0.0030212,-0.01962158,-0.0364772,0.0273811,0.01240039,-0.02129229,0.00639047,-0.01477651,0.06809077,0.00455037,-0.03120517,-0.03324715,-0.00263137,-0.00125535,0.05995997,0.01261387,-0.00956946,0.01056261,-0.0002261,0.02918176,0.03560471,-0.00657611,0.04418103,-0.02214621,-0.00348993,0.04418103,0.01784877,-0.00042406,0.0300728,0.03265312,0.022963,-0.00845566,-0.05394541,-0.02394686,-0.04819074,0.00158602,0.00612594,0.04529484,0.00325557,0.03994856,-0.00880372,0.04295584,-0.04975007,-0.04559185,0.00573147,0.06664281,-0.01255818,0.05305436,0.05498496,0.01637297,-0.00791732,-0.00693345,0.00767135,0.00439026,0.00104884,0.00153729,-0.00701235,-0.00178673,-0.03237467,-0.02493073,0.03909464,-0.02986861,0.07380831,0.02498641,-0.0370341,0.01764457,-0.09957439,0.0030096,0.00501677,-0.01885119,0.02485647,-0.00517921,0.